ROPERTY VIEW EXPERIENCE\n* Live-In Tours: 360-degree view of your preferred property from the comfort of your house. \n* E-Models: 3D visualization of the property to assist in selection and decision-making process.\n* Sky Views: Aerial view of the property to help build the context of the surroundings around the project. \n* Street Views: Tour the Beacon with 3D navigation street panorama view.\n* Roof Top Views: A real-time rooftop view at the beacon to understand and feels fresh while making a decision on buying a flat.\n* Locality Virtual Tours: Envision the locality and surroundings through The Beacon App.", "short_description": "The Beacon Offers Luxurious Sustainable Living Apartments in Hemel Hempstead, UK"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thebeacondevelopment.co.uk/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thebeacondevelopment.co.uk/", "publisher_name": "Lumiere Developments Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.thebeacondevelopment.co.uk/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL", "EXPLORATION", "NARRATIVE", "SOCIAL", "UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1095190504388955"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "149491568929517"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "149491568929517"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1498064400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "149491568929517"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_bina